title: "Brewery Batches CLI built with Pixeltable"
abstract: "A command-line tool for a brewery's fermentation log: batches and hydrometer readings as Pixeltable tables, ABV and attenuation from expression UDFs, temperature-corrected gravity readings, and the same commands against Pixeltable Cloud."
